v3_position_changes.txt lists exactly the 52 positions and every changed field that my independent diff finds, so it is complete on field names. The V3_CHANGES table rows (blockers 1-3, majors 1-9, Not done) are accurate against the ledger, and so are the 52/40 split and the 030351 Metal-step note. Five problems, all minor (regress-n1..n5):
- the 'By field' counts mix units and mislabel one category;
- the Oct 12 'byte-for-byte as they were' wording only holds against main's converter, not main's committed file;
- the claim of a 'was' check on every correction holds for only 5 of 7 entries;
- notes values in v3_position_changes.txt are cut at about 150 characters, so removed notes are invisible;
- correction notes land on positions before the corrected event.
